@startuml

title Fluxo Principal - n8n Webhook de Eventos de Ticket

autoactivate on

participant "Backend\n(TicketService)" as Service
participant "N8nClient" as Client
participant "n8n Webhook Trigger" as Webhook
participant "n8n Workflow" as Workflow
participant "Acoes\n(Email/Slack/CRM)" as Actions

Service -> Client: notify_ticket_updated(ticket_id, status)
Client -> Webhook: POST JSON
note right of Client
payload:
- ticket_id
- status
end note

Webhook -> Workflow: inicia execucao
Workflow -> Actions: processa regras de negocio
Actions --> Workflow: resultado
Workflow --> Webhook: finalizado
Webhook --> Client: HTTP 2xx

alt erro no POST
  Client --> Service: excecao HTTPError
  Service -> Service: registrar log de falha
end

@enduml
